1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,500
I am Lunokhod 1, and my story began on the Moon in 1970.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Engineers from the Soviet Union built me,

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,300
and I became the first robotic rover to successfully roam the lunar surface.

4
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,000
I had eight wheels,

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,000
and a team on Earth drove me from afar, seeing the way through my cameras.

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,300
They prepared me for a mission of about three months,

7
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,500
but I went on for about eleven months,

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,900
and I traveled more than ten kilometers, photographing and examining the lunar soil.

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,600
I worked during the day,

10
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:29,300
and waited for the long night to pass so I could continue,

11
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:33,100
until the night of 1971 came,

12
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,400
and after that I never answered them again.

13
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:36,900
I am still standing there,

14
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:41,900
and when you look at the Moon, remember that a small explorer came before you and paved the way.
